    "rank0": "All finite-dimensional volume/Gaussian producers include dimension zero; no determinant/rank division introduced.",
    "zero_normal_or_rate": "Literal total reflection and nonnegative actual density unchanged; never divide by rate or density.",
    "infinite_tests": "ENNReal all-test equality, with no finite-integral assumption or subtraction."
